{#
  One row of the formation-mapping block: a raw Desk value, what the site
  currently knows about it, and the form that decides (or re-decides) which
  step it means.

  Written once because the two lists it serves — « Valeurs non reconnues »
  and « Rattachements déjà enregistrés » — are the same row with a
  different verb. They had drifted already: only one of them offered a
  placeholder option, and only one had a remove button, which is correct;
  but the select's width, its visually-hidden label and its size were
  three chances for them to stop matching for no reason.

  A list, not a table, deliberately (see training.html.twig): four columns
  of a select, a button and a variable-length Desk string do not fit a
  375px screen, and a control a chief has to scroll sideways to reach is
  not "lisible sur téléphone".

  Parameters:
    raw_value        -- the Desk string itself
    detail           -- the French sentence under it (how many people, or
                        which step it is attached to)
    field_id         -- unique id for the select
    steps            -- assignable_steps: [{ value, label }, …]
    selected         -- the step value currently chosen, or null for a
                        value nobody has decided yet
    submit_label     -- « Rattacher » or « Modifier »
    removable        -- whether to offer the trash button (only a decision
                        can be undone; there is nothing to remove from a
                        value nobody decided)
#}
{% set _selected = selected|default(null) %}
{% set _options = steps|default([])|map(step => {
    value: step.value,
    label: step.label,
    selected: _selected is not null and step.value == _selected,
}) %}
{% if _selected is null %}
    {% set _options = [{ value: '', label: 'Choisir une étape…' }]|merge(_options) %}
{% endif %}

<li class="list-group-item px-0 py-3">
    <div class="fw-semibold text-break"><code>{{ raw_value }}</code></div>
    <div class="small text-body-secondary mb-2">{{ detail }}</div>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-center">
        <form method="post" action="/admin/leadership/training/mapping"
              class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-center">
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
            <input type="hidden" name="raw_value" value="{{ raw_value }}">
            {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                field_id: field_id,
                field_name: 'step',
                label: 'Étape pour « ' ~ raw_value ~ ' »',
                label_visually_hidden: true,
                type: 'select',
                size: 'sm',
                control_class_extra: 'w-auto',
                wrapper_class: 'mb-0',
                options: _options,
            } only %}
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">{{ submit_label }}</button>
        </form>
        {% if removable|default(false) %}
            <form method="post" action="/admin/leadership/training/mapping"
                  data-confirm="Supprimer le rattachement de « {{ raw_value }} » ? Cette valeur redeviendra non reconnue tant qu'elle ne sera pas rattachée à nouveau.">
                {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                <input type="hidden" name="raw_value" value="{{ raw_value }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="step" value="">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger"
                        aria-label="Supprimer le rattachement de {{ raw_value }}">
                    <i class="bi bi-trash" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </button>
            </form>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</li>
